    <!-- Vector icons on a 16 by 16 grid, drawn as 1.25-unit strokes by AppIcon
         (ApiConnectTool/Views/Components/AppIcon.cs) with theme token brushes. Lines sit on half units
         so they land on pixel centers at 100% scaling. No emoji, icon fonts or bitmaps. -->
